---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Accessibility statement', href: '/accessibility/' }];
---
<Base title="Accessibility | AE Factory Sales" description="AE Factory Sales is committed to an accessible website that meets WCAG 2.2 Level AA." crumbs={crumbs}>
  <PageHero crumbs={crumbs}><h1 class="display">Accessibility <span class="y">statement</span></h1></PageHero>
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>Last updated November 18, 2026.</p>
      <p>We want everyone to be able to use this website, including people who use screen readers, keyboards, magnification or other assistive technology.</p>
      <h2>Our standard</h2>
      <p>We build and test this site to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at Level AA. Every update is checked with automated accessibility testing on desktop and phone before it goes live, along with keyboard checks.</p>
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Text alternatives for photos and renders</li>
        <li>Full keyboard access, a skip link and visible focus</li>
        <li>Color contrast that meets AA</li>
        <li>Labeled form fields and clear error messages</li>
        <li>Videos can be paused, and animations stop for people who turn on reduced motion</li>
        <li>No accessibility overlay widgets</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Known limits</h2>
      <p>The patio visualizer works by dragging corners on a photo. Corners can also be moved with the arrow keys. If any part of the site is hard to use, we will gladly help by phone or email and give you the same information and pricing.</p>
      <h2>Tell us</h2>
      <p>If you hit a barrier, please let us know and we will fix it: email {SITE.email} or call {SITE.phone}. We aim to reply within 2 business days.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
